      "x": 54,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 870,
      "height": 35,
      "text": "Staleness bound: if the newest at-or-before value is older than max_staleness, it's",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text-25",
      "x": 54,
      "y": 482,
      "width": 870,
      "height": 35,
      "text": "treated as expired (None) - a stale feature is often as wrong as a missing one. The",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text-26",
      "x": 54,
      "y": 514,
      "width": 870,
      "height": 35,
      "text": "leakage fuzz suite checks this against a brute-force oracle thousands of times.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    }
